Description:
    Creates the invoice and line item models Tallyman renders, and a migration
    for their tables with every column Tallyman reads.

    The models are called Invoice and LineItem unless you name them with
    --invoice-name and --line-item-name. Names can be CamelCase or under_scored.

    Pass --skip-migration to generate the models only.

Examples:
    rails generate tallyman:setup

        Creates the Invoice and LineItem models and a migration for the
        invoices and line_items tables.

    rails generate tallyman:setup --invoice-name=Bill --line-item-name=Charge

        Creates the Bill and Charge models and a migration for the bills and
        charges tables. A bill still reaches its charges through line_items,
        which is the name Tallyman looks for.
